@page "/components/logo-cloud"

<PageTitle>Logo Cloud — Unpoly.Blazor.Shadcn</PageTitle>

<h1 class="doc-h1">Logo Cloud</h1>
<p class="doc-lede">
    The "trusted by" strip of partner and customer logos, after Nexus UI's logo clouds on 21st.dev.
    One list of logos and a <code>Variant</code> for how they are shown: a still cloud, one row, a
    marquee, a spotlight, a blur-in, or cells that swap.
</p>

<h2 class="doc-h2">Basic</h2>
<Example Source="LogoCloudExample.razor" Block><LogoCloudExample /></Example>

<h2 class="doc-h2">Single row</h2>
<Example Source="LogoCloudRow.razor" Block><LogoCloudRow /></Example>

<h2 class="doc-h2">Marquee</h2>
<p class="doc-note">
    The scroll is a CSS animation, so it runs with scripting off. It pauses under the pointer and
    while focus is inside, and under reduced motion it does not run at all. The list is in the
    markup twice so the loop has no seam; the second copy is <code>inert</code> and hidden from
    assistive technology, and one copy has to be at least as wide as the cloud.
</p>
<Example Source="LogoCloudMarquee.razor" Block><LogoCloudMarquee /></Example>

<h2 class="doc-h2">Spotlight</h2>
<Example Source="LogoCloudSpotlight.razor" Block><LogoCloudSpotlight /></Example>

<h2 class="doc-h2">Blur in</h2>
<Example Source="LogoCloudBlur.razor" Block><LogoCloudBlur /></Example>

<h2 class="doc-h2">Swap</h2>
<p class="doc-note">
    <code>Visible</code> logos show at once and the rest take turns. The swapping runs only while
    the cloud is on screen and the tab is visible, and not at all under reduced motion.
</p>
<Example Source="LogoCloudSwap.razor" Block><LogoCloudSwap /></Example>
